  "goodToKnow": "Die Obhut is care or custody: in jemandes Obhut, in guter Obhut sein (to be in good hands), jemandem etwas in Obhut geben. In German child protection law, the Jugendamt can take a child in Obhut (Inobhutnahme) in an emergency. It's formal; everyday alternatives are die Pflege and die Betreuung. From old ob (over) and Hut (protection). It has no plural."
